ondamentale. Le rythme doit être confortable. Adapte ton allure à la forme du jour pour que le ressenti de la séance reste vraiment facile.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"C’est tentant de speeder pendant tes footings, pas vrai ? On connaît tous ça, c’est tellement simple de se laisser aller. Mais si tu veux vraiment avancer, il faut apprendre à te freiner. Accélérer, même un peu, ça fatigue ton corps et ça risque de te limiter pour ta prochaine séance intense… et donc de ralentir tes progrès. (Je le redis, parce que c’est essentiel !)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_45","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":328,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1785715200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2700,"pace":{"value":328}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"VMA_600_Cote_1","description":"Classique séance de 30/45 **EN COTE**. On enchaîne **10 fois** 30\" intenses suivies de 45\" de footing lent pour te laisser le temps de redescendre.","displayName":"VMA en Cote","coachAdvice":"Bienvenue dans ta première séance de VO2, c’est une allure élevée, qui va te faire monter haut dans les tours au niveau du cardio… Mais cette séance est assez simple vu ton niveau. Simple ne veut pas dire que tu dois accélérer. Remplis le contrat, ni plus, ni moins.","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"trail_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"WU_20 ","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":328,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":10,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"VMA_Cote_0.5","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VO2max","value":212,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"vo2max","context":"intensity","perception":"very-high"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"uphill","manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"Recup_Down_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance confort","value":341,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-confort","context":"pace","perception":"easy"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"downhill","manualLap":true}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":328,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":3,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1785715200000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a71f1d7acae7cee22794a89","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1785715200000,"sessionIndex":2,"choRecommendation":1,"formSuggestions":["semi-liquid","liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1":{"homemade":[[{"datoId":"fV5sxS6dTOmJgqP6qnmqoA","name":"Velouté de tomates spécial effort","form":"liquid","info":{"quantity":{"value":200,"metric":"mL"},"cho":{"value":12,"metric":"g"},"sodium":{"value":820,"metric":"mg"}}}],[{"datoId":"UMD5Rt1ESQ25KBXonqCm0