s que nécessaires. Elles aident ton corps à bien encaisser les semaines plus intenses et te permettent ensuite de repartir du bon pied, sans risque de blessure, ce qui doit être ta priorité numéro un en tant que coureur ! (car un coureur blessé progresse toujours moins qu'un coureur qui en fait un peu moins mais qui est régulier !)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_20","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":323,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1795996800000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1200},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1200,"pace":{"value":323}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"EF_20+3LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Comme l'indique la description de l'entrainement, si tu te sens très fatigué(e), n'hésite pas à supprimer les lignes droites et rentre directement te reposer ! Elles sont optionnelles, pour garder le corps habitué à des intensités très élevées, mais le principal est de ne pas générer de fatigue inutile ici.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_17","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":323,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":17,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VO2max","value":210,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"vo2max","context":"intensity","perception":"very-high"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"Recup_Indif_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance confort","value":335,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-confort","context":"pace","perception":"easy"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1795996800000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1200},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1020,"pace":{"value":323}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":210}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":335}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":210}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":335}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":210}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":335}}]},{"_t":"SmartPPGSessionWithStats","name":"PERF - MID - AUTRE - SEMAINE 4 SEANCE 2","description":"Séance en 3 blocs. Les deux premiers blocs sont composés de 3 séries de 2 exercices enchainés sans pause. Le troisième bloc est composé de 2 séries de 2x2 exercices différents alternés, enchainés sans pause. Prend 1'  de récupération entre les séries des bloc 1 et 2, et 2' entre les séries du bloc 3. ","displayName":"Renforcement","coachAdvice":"Les débuts peuvent être durs, mais avec chaque séance, les exercices deviendront plus naturels, tu auras moins de courbatures (oui je sais) et tu ressentiras les bénéfices sur ta course et ta santé. C'est pour ça qu'il vaut mieux commencer doucement et tenir dans la durée que partir sur les chapeaux de roues et lâcher l'affaire.","importance":true,"trainingType":"PPG","trainingCategory":"gpp","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartPPGExercise","name":"Extension de Mollet","exerciseType":"ppg","sport":"ppg","difficulty":"intense","repeat":15,"durations":[],"gearVariation":{"difficultyAdjustedWithWeights":false,"difficultyVariations":[{"name":"Extension de Mollet à 2 pieds","description":"","variationType":"simplified","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394699-dsc4256.png","muxPlaybackId":"LRwmfIIbjAq00CUzgNV9QJD00cjxpce6mY","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394699-dsc4256.png","muxPlaybackId":"wEJw8kcN6TSOZ2k7EYrOxnzFlrfkS3XX","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Extension de Mollet à 1 pied","description":"","variationType":"standard","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394758-dsc4263.png","muxPlaybackId":"1R00Rw81qTAo69DGhdMVO1ZhipUK5euzU","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://image.mux.com/dlCXEee8u01EZxzO1zB7raAYosslztFte/thumbnail.jpg","muxPlaybackId":"dlCXEee8u01EZxzO1zB7raAYosslztFte","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Extension Mollet à 1 pied avec charge additionnelle","description":"","variationType":"advanced","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394833-dsc4270.png","muxPlaybackId":"4IWQj9FusbAG6rA2bIJd6kf3gJzgQCEn","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394833-dsc4270.png","muxPlaybackId":"01brVbo2iL201c02T5ep7PjTZ00nODTWfkJb","format":"mobile"}]}],"gear":"weights","name":"Extension de Mollet"}},{"_t":"SmartPPGExercise","n