e":{"value":335}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":250}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":120,"pace":{"value":250}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":120,"pace":{"value":335}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":250}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":120,"pace":{"value":250}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":120,"pace":{"value":335}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":300,"pace":{"value":322}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le rythme doit être confortable. Adapte ton allure à la forme du jour pour que le ressenti de la séance reste vraiment facile.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Lors des footings, un des objectifs est de développer ton système cardio-respiratoire et certaines adaptations ne peuvent se faire qu'à cette allure lente, respecte-la, elle fait partie d'un entraînement efficace !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":322,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1798416000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":322}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"EF_45+6LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Comme l'indique la description de l'entrainement, si tu te sens très fatigué(e), n'hésite pas à supprimer les lignes droites et rentre directement te reposer ! Elles sont optionnelles, pour garder le corps habitué à des intensités très élevées, mais le principal est de ne pas générer de fatigue inutile ici.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_39","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":322,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":39,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":6,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VO2max","value":208,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"vo2max","context":"intensity","perception":"very-high"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"Recup_Indif_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance confort","value":335,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-confort","context":"pace","perception":"easy"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":3,"weekDate":1798416000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2340,"pace":{"value":322}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":208}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":335}},{"kind"